  "description": "**Available Immediately** **Fully furnished** Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to present this three double bedrooms, two bathroom, sixth floor apartment extending to approx. 102sqm and with parking available for two cars. This apartment has been completely refurbished to a very high standard, Accommodation comprises bright and spacious kitchen complete with dishwasher, microwave, washing machine, dryer & fridge freezer and a lovely living room off with balcony overlooking Herbert Park. There are three good sized double bedrooms one with an ensuite and main bathroom. All bedrooms have a large amount of built in wardrobe space. Viewing highly recommended of this beautiful property. **Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**\n",
